              "text": "Because Domino's primarily uses \"one-click\" coupons on their official website and app rather than traditional typed promo codes, the easiest way to save is by adding deals directly to your cart. \n\nThe most valuable Domino's deals and voucher offers currently available include:\n\n### 1. Today\u2019s Top Deal (Ends Tonight!)\n* **50% Off All Menu-Priced Pizzas**\n  * **Details:** To celebrate National Dairy Month, Domino's is offering half off all pizzas at menu price. This applies to all specialty pizzas and across all six crust types.\n  * **How to get it:** No promo code is required. Simply go to the **Deals** or **Coupons** page on the Domino's app or website and click **\"Add Deal\"**. \n  * **Expiration:** **Sunday, June 7, 2026** (Today is the final day!).\n\n### 2. Ongoing National Deals (No Codes Needed)\nThese are long-running national coupons that you can apply directly from the Domino's Deals menu:\n\n* **The Mix & Match Deal \u2013 $6.99 each**\n  * **Details:** Choose any two or more medium 2-topping pizzas, breads (like Stuffed Cheesy Bread or Bread Bites), pastas, sandwiches, salads, or desserts for just $6.99 each. *(Note: Prices may be slightly higher in select locations).*\n* **The Weeklong Carryout Deal \u2013 $7.99 each**\n  * **Details:** Carry out a large 1-topping pizza (on any of their 6 crust types), an 8-piece order of wings/boneless chicken, or a Dips & Twists combo for $7.99.\n* **The Perfect Combo \u2013 $19.99**\n  * **Details:** Get two medium 1-topping pizzas, a 16-piece order of Parmesan Bread Bites, and an 8-piece order of Cinnamon Twists for $19.99.\n* **Free Slice Sauce Offer (Through June 14, 2026)**\n  * **Details:** Order a Handmade Pan or Parmesan Stuffed Crust Pizza online to receive a free Slice Sauce dip cup with your order.\n\n---\n\n### How to Find Local Promo Codes for Your Specific Store\nBecause many Domino's franchises are individually owned, the best promo codes are often regional. To find codes specific to your local store:\n1. Go to the [Domino's Coupon Page](https://www.dominos.com/en/pages/coupon/).\n2. Enter your zip code and select whether you want **Carryout** or **Delivery**.\n3. The site will generate a list of local-only coupons and promo codes (such as free sides, 20% off entire orders, or free delivery minimums) that are active right now at your closest location.\n\n### Extra Savings Tips\n* **Student Discount:** If you are a student, you can log into UNiDAYS to unlock a **35% off** coupon code to use on your online orders. \n* **Domino's Rewards:** Sign up for the free Domino's Rewards program. You earn points on every order of $10 or more, and once you hit 60 points, you can redeem them for a **free medium 2-topping pizza**.",
